### Get error data
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/ErrorLogSet HTTP/1.1

### Get prperty data
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/ErrorLogSet('a9c365a9-d73c-4927-944d-e16e43b488c0')?$select=Source_payload HTTP/1.1

# media
# ######
# POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/ErrorLogSet HTTP/1.1
